{"type":"message","id":"1147e49e","parentId":"5b36f694","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:03:24.576Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, I tested it.\n\nResult:\n- The FAQ answer is **not on the same line as the question**\n- **But** it also does **not** have a blank line between question and answer\n\nCurrent format in the article:\n- `**Question?**`\n- `Answer starts immediately on the next line`\n\nWanted format:\n- `**Question?**`\n- blank line\n- `Answer starts here`\n\nSo the FAQ formatting is **failing the desired style**.\n\nWhat I found:\n- FAQ items checked: **5**\n- Formatting issues found: **5**\n- Same problem on every FAQ item\n\nWhy this slipped through:\n- The current validator checks **FAQ count**\n- It does **not** check **FAQ spacing / blank-line formatting**\n\nSo:\n- **Problem:** FAQ formatting validator is too weak\n- **Solution:** add a validation rule that requires:\n  1. question on its own line  \n  2. one blank line after it  \n  3. answer starts after that blank line\n\nIf you want, I can patch that validator next so the pipeline rejects this format automatically."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":639,"output":525,"cacheRead":52096,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":53260,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779368595210,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhxLQWn8heGG1wRPDPAeVdjL0xhTw"}}
{"type":"message","id":"89348aac","parentId":"1147e49e","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:05:25.202Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"telegram:5691449303\",\n  \"message_id\": \"671\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"670\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"5691449303\",\n  \"sender\": \"Sawan bhardwaj\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-21 13:05 UTC\",\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Sawan bhardwaj (5691449303)\",\n  \"id\": \"5691449303\",\n  \"name\": \"Sawan bhardwaj\",\n  \"username\": \"hero_fr_fun\"\n}\n```\n\nReplied message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"sender_label\": \"seo_agent_openclaw_bot\",\n  \"body\": \"Yes, I tested it.\\n\\nResult:\\n\\n• The FAQ answer is not on the same line as the question\\n• But it also does not have a blank line between question and answer\\n\\nCurrent format in the article:\\n\\n• **Question?**\\n• Answer starts immediately on the next line\\n\\nWanted format:\\n\\n• **Question?**\\n• blank line\\n• Answer starts here\\n\\nSo the FAQ formatting is failing the desired style.\\n\\nWhat I found:\\n\\n• FAQ items checked: 5\\n• Formatting issues found: 5\\n• Same problem on every FAQ item\\n\\nWhy this slipped through:\\n\\n• The current validator checks FAQ count\\n• It does not check FAQ spacing / blank-line formatting\\n\\nSo:\\n\\n• Problem: FAQ formatting validator is too weak\\n• Solution: add a validation rule that requires:\\n  1. question on its own line\\n  2. one blank line after it\\n  3. answer starts after that blank line\\n\\nIf you want, I can patch that validator next so the pipeline rejects this format automatically.\"\n}\n```\n\nwhy don't we test it with real agent calls first test the writer agent if the writer is writing the question an danswer in same line not even doing the new next line for anwers just verify this"}],"timestamp":1779368725195}}
